The '''Bartender''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Combat Settlement}} and {{zone|Tavern}}. They give the player an {{Item|Undead Sword}} and task them with killing {{Green|10}} {{MobSprite|Zombie}}s or {{MobSprite|Graveyard Zombie}}s. After killing the Zombies, the player must travel to the [[Spider's Den]]. The '''Bartender''' will then open their shop to the player. 

== Quest ==
The '''Bartender''' is the first [[NPC]] that the player is directed to speaking to as a [[Quest]] after joining the [[Hub Island]]. Upon speaking to them, they give the player an {{Item|Undead Sword}}, then task them with killing 10 {{MobSprite|Zombie}}s or {{MobSprite|Graveyard Zombie}}s. Doing so grants the player {{SkyBlock XP|+5}} and {{Skill XP|100 Combat}}. After speaking to the '''Bartender''' again, the player earns {{Coins|100}}, and after switching servers, they then move to the {{Zone|Tavern}} to sell items. 

